CVE-2026-58050 # libssh2: no distro fix yet in the 10 first-party bookworm images that carry it (empty FixedVersion there); influxdb:2.9.1's own libssh2 build shows FixedVersion 1.10.0-3+deb12u1, but influxdb is a pulled third-party image we do not build, so that fix is not ours to apply -- kept ignored for the shared-package majority rather than false-red the 10 images that are still genuinely unfixed (see PR body: needs-decision, plain-text .trivyignore has no per-image scoping)
